<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets New World Development warrants.</title>
<headline>BZW sets New World Development warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Wednesday it has launched 75 million American-style call warrants on shares of New World Development.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$40.85     PREMIUM	   10.76 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.678     GEARING	   6.34X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	16.OCT.97    PAYDATE	   31.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   Hong Kong    MIN EXER LOT    10,000</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE	HK$43.00</p>
<p> NOTES	     GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
